# Story 2.1: Frontend Intelligence Theater Implementation

## Status
Draft

## Story
**As a** ProspectPI Intelligence Theater user,  
**I want** a responsive web frontend that implements the Intelligence Theater UX design,  
**so that** I can interact with the 3-agent system through an intuitive interface and watch real-time dossier generation.

## Acceptance Criteria
1. Smart Input Interface - Implement company name input with expandable context section following Story 2.2 specifications
2. Agent Progress Theater - Display real-time 3-column agent dashboard with live status updates via WebSocket
3. CIA-Style Dossier Viewer - Render structured intelligence dossiers with expandable sections and confidence indicators
4. User Authentication Flow - Login/registration forms connecting to existing JWT authentication system
5. Existing backend API endpoints (Stories 1.2-1.4) continue to work unchanged
6. New frontend follows existing Story 2.2 UX patterns exactly
7. Integration with existing WebSocket system maintains current real-time behavior
8. Frontend is covered by appropriate tests (React Testing Library)
9. Mobile-responsive design following Story 2.2 specifications
10. No regression in existing backend functionality verified

## Dev Notes

### Story Context

**Existing System Integration:**
- **Integrates with:** Complete backend REST API (Stories 1.1-1.4), WebSocket system, user authentication
- **Technology:** React/TypeScript frontend connecting to existing Node.js/TypeScript backend
- **Follows pattern:** Story 2.2 UX specifications, existing API interfaces from Story 1.2
- **Touch points:** `/api/research/requests`, `/api/auth`, WebSocket connections for real-time updates

### Technical Notes

- **Integration Approach:** Create React SPA that consumes existing REST API and WebSocket connections
- **Existing Pattern Reference:** Story 2.2 UX Design Specifications for all UI components
- **Key Constraints:** Must use existing API interfaces from Story 1.2, maintain backend compatibility

### Frontend Architecture Overview
The frontend must implement the complete Intelligence Theater user experience:
1. **Authentication Layer**: Login/registration with JWT token management
2. **Smart Input Interface**: Company research request form with context options
3. **Real-Time Theater**: 3-agent progress dashboard with WebSocket updates
4. **Dossier Presentation**: CIA-style document viewer with structured intelligence

